{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-ii", "title": "滕文公下", "description": "陳代曰：「不見諸侯，宜若小然；今一見之，大則以王，小則以霸。且志曰：『枉尺而直尋』，宜若可為也。」\n孟子曰：「昔齊景公田，招虞人以旌，不至，將殺之。志士不忘在溝壑，勇士不忘喪其元。孔子奚取焉？取非其招不往也，如不待其招而往，何哉？且夫枉尺而直尋者，以利言也。如以利，則枉尋直尺而利，亦可為與？昔者趙簡子使王良與嬖奚乘，終", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "伯", "id": "伯"}, {"form": "兄", "id": "兄"}, {"form": "室", "id": "室"}, {"form": "害", "id": "害"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "獸", "id": "獸"}, {"form": "率", "id": "率"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "祿", "id": "祿"}, {"form": "禽", "id": "禽"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}, {"form": "驅", "id": "驅"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.5182939183735165, "source": "人", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 0.9457379332004561, "source": "人", "target": "害"}, {"weight": 1.1970523614813622, "source": "人", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 1.6388851137604015, "source": "人", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 0.9457379332004561, "source": "人", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.2525907526405108, "source": "人", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.4657359027997265, "source": "兄", "target": "祿"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "兄", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.772588722239781, "source": "兄", "target": "室"}, {"weight": 2.772588722239781, "source": "兄", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 3.619886582626985, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.9267394020670396, "source": "義", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.6739764335716716, "source": "義", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 2.521274293958875, "source": "義", "target": "率"}, {"weight": 0.4843923666978352, "source": "義", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 2.9267394020670396, "source": "義", "target": "祿"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "義", "target": "室"}, {"weight": 2.367123614131617, "source": "仁", "target": "獸"}, {"weight": 3.2144214745188204, "source": "